## Development

```bash
{{installCmd}}
cp .env.example .env.local
{{run}} dev
```

`{{run}} dev` watch-builds and deploys into `$OBSIDIAN_VAULT`. Install the
community **Hot Reload** plugin in the test vault once — dev builds write a
`.hotreload` marker so every rebuild reloads the plugin in place.

## Quality gates

Run the whole local gate set with one command:

```bash
{{run}} verify
```

See `docs/quality-integration-guide.md` for how the ratchets work.

## Release

```bash
{{versionCmd}}   # bumps package.json + manifest.json + versions.json
git push --follow-tags
```

The tag push builds and attaches `main.js`, `manifest.json`, and `styles.css`
to a GitHub release (when the release workflow is enabled).
